      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $N,$ given by\n\n$$\nN=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -9 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2}$ on $N?$",
